{{!
  Renders its block anew, every component in it created again, whenever @key
  changes. Ember keeps a component as long as its place in the template stays,
  also when the route refreshes and only the model changes, so components that
  copy an argument when they are created (the address search, the rich-text
  editor, the qualifications choice) would keep showing the old values. An
  each over a one-item list keyed by the value replaces the block instead.
}}
{{#each (array @key) key="@identity"}}
  {{yield}}
{{/each}}